<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Xpress raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Xpress raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for U.S. Xpress Enterprises Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Chattanooga, Tenn., trucking company closed on Tuesday at 13-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
